      "name": "14. History Without League (400)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/api/matches",
        "description": "旧全件経路の拒否。名前設定済みは400 INVALID_INPUT。"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "15. Scoped History Adapter",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/api/matches?league_id={{league_id}}&season=all&limit=20",
        "description": "所属リーグの通常対局だけ。season: all/unassigned/UUID、status: all/valid/cancelled、limit: 1〜100、cursor: 同じ条件のnext_cursor。 pointは分子と分母が整数文字列の既約分数。"
      },
      "response": []
